{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34373","headline":"偶掇野蔬寄袭美有作 · 陆龟蒙","name":"偶掇野蔬寄袭美有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野园烟里自幽寻，嫩甲香蕤引渐深。\n行歇每依鵶舅影，挑频时见鼠姑心。\n凌风蔼彩初携笼，带露虚疎或贮襟。\n欲助春盘还爱否，不妨萧洒似家林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34373.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34373","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}